This is a protoype tool developed with Clinton Health Access Initiative. It is an Early Warning Alerts and Responses System against
33 infectious diseases tailored to the State of Madhya Pradesh which was showcased in the Global Digital Health Forum conference in Kenya (2025).
For description of the full working tool access this [link] (https://docs.google.com/document/d/1aOSmICRO4fJ_Ei8nD0bd1PGApO0TBuG49Xl-sslA0PU/edit?usp=sharing)
